# Documentation and claims

Update affected documentation, compatibility matrices, testing documentation, fixture evidence, plans, checklists, feature inventory, and scorecards.

Documentation must match executed evidence.

Do not claim: a feature from a test name alone; full support from partial coverage; mutation compatibility from parse-only tests; frozen acceptance when the external tool was not run; installed-graph verification when only lockfile bytes were checked; Nub executable support from derived fixtures; final readiness before final exact-SHA CI is green.

Correct stale documentation and stale branch or pull-request references.
<!-- MEW-DOCUMENTATION_END -->
